SUBSTANTIAL MODIFICATIONS

This product has been substantially modified and enhanced by subsequent contributors:

- Vladimir Nikic - Original Author (2006-2013)
  Designed original processor-based architecture, XML configuration system, and Swing-based IDE

- Robert Bala - Project Admin & Lead Developer (2012-2025)
  https://www.linkedin.com/in/rbala
  Designed modern plugin architecture (2012+), event-driven system, and cloud-ready infrastructure
  Led comprehensive modernization (2024-2025)

- Alexander Wajda - Developer (2010-2012)
- Piotr Dyraga - Developer (2012-2013)
- Maciej Czapiewski - Developer (2012-2013)
- and other contributors

Modern plugin architecture and infrastructure (2012+):
- Auto-discovered plugin system with @CorePlugin annotations
- Event-driven architecture for distributed and cloud environments
- Dependency injection with Google Guice
- Modern session management and token tracking

Major refactoring and modernization work (2024-2025):
- Migration to modern Java (Java 11+)
- Complete codebase refactoring
- Web-based IDE implementation (replaced Swing GUI)
- Modern HTTP client (Apache HttpClient 5, replaced Commons HttpClient 3.x)
- Comprehensive test coverage (2600+ tests)
- WebSocket support for real-time execution
- Database connection pooling
- Enhanced error handling and logging
- And numerous other improvements

